<title>MEXICO: Mexico department, supermarket sales fall in Aug.</title>
<headline>Mexico department, supermarket sales fall in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Mexican department stores fell 9.8 percent in August compared to a year earlier, while supermarket sales were down 3.6 percent, the National Association of Supermarket and Department Stores (ANTAD) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The decline in department store sales was the second straight following two months of gains.</p>
<p>The figures were based on a national index of sales adjusted to a same-store basis.</p>
<p>-- David Luhnow, Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9565</p>
